            <sourceDesc>
                <msDesc>
                    <msIdentifier>
                        <repository>museum/archive</repository>
                        <idno>inventory number</idno>
                    </msIdentifier>
                    <physDesc>
                        <objectDesc>
                            <supportDesc>
                                <support><p><rs type="execution">Painted</rs> on the south <objectType>wall</objectType> of the sanctuary<material/><dimensions/></p></support>
                            </supportDesc>
                            <layoutDesc>
                                <layout>Inscribed within a rectangular ruled panel; white background, black border (the date at the end is painted below the panel, against the gray background). This applies to the text repainted in the 18th century, which reproduces the original 17th-century inscription.</layout>
                            </layoutDesc>
                        </objectDesc>
                        <handDesc>
                            <handNote>Majuscules with decorative serifs, accents and breathings, several ligatures and borrowings from minuscule; the script is neatly organized by following the lines of the ruling. The date below is painted by a different hand. These characteristics apply to the 18th-century text, but it is possible that the latter imitates the script of the original 17th-century inscription. <height>2,5 cm</height>
                            </handNote>
                        </handDesc>
                    </physDesc>
                    <history>
                        <origin>
                            <origPlace>Place of origin</origPlace>
                            <origDate>1652</origDate>
                        </origin>
                        <provenance type="found"> Vatopedi, Main church (katholikon), sanctuary
                        </provenance>
                        <provenance type="observed">Modern location(s) (if different from repository, above)
                        </provenance>
                        <provenance type="not-observed">Repainted</provenance>
                    </history>
                </msDesc>
            </sourceDesc>
