    <facsimile>
        <graphic url="Vat03a.jpg"><desc>General view of the door lintel and the inscription</desc></graphic>
    </facsimile>
    <text>
        <body>
            <div type="edition" xml:space="preserve">
                <ab>
                    <lg>
                      <l n="1"><lb n="1"/><g ref="#crux">†</g><persName type="divine" key="Virgin Mary">Ανασα</persName> πάντων ὕψι βρωτῶν ὑπάρχης</l>
                      <l n="2"><lb n="2"/>προστάτης ἄμαχως τον καταπονουμένων</l>
                      <l n="3"><lb n="3"/>καταφηγί τε τῶν ης <supplied reason="omitted">σ</supplied>ὲ προστρεχόντων,</l>
                      <l n="4"><lb n="4"/>ἐλπῖς βεβέα. ἔμι γε τοῦ παντλίμου</l>
                      <l n="5"><persName type="attested" ref="#pers5">Θεὁδοσίου</persName> <lb n="5"/>του <placeName type="ethnic">Πελοπονησίου</placeName></l>
                      <l n="6">ἡκέτου ἡκτροῦ τῆς σῆς <lb n="6"/>ἀγαθοσύνης</l>
                      <l n="7">δι’ον σι τῶνδε καλο<choice><corr>ν</corr><sic>π</sic></choice> εμοῦ <lb n="7"/>προσάξας</l>
                      <l n="8">τα σά ἐκ των σῶν θησαυροῦ ἀκενότου</l>
                      <l n="8"><lb n="8"/>καθῶς ζωην τε <expan><abbr>κ</abbr><ex>αὶ</ex></expan> ψυχὴν παρεθέμην</l>
                      <l n="10">ἡς χήρας <lb n="9"/>ἀχ<unclear>ρ</unclear>άντου<choice><corr>ς</corr><sic>β</sic></choice> τε τὴς σῆς μεγαλοσύνης.</l>
                    </lg>
                        <lb n="10"/><date from="1652-01-01" to="1652-12-31"><num value="1652">αχνβ</num></date> 
                </ab>
            </div>
            <div type="apparatus">
                <p>The text has been repainted as part of the 18th-century renovation of the decoration of the sanctuary, which also included the repainting of the patron's portrait. It is generally accepted that the 18th-century painter reproduced the original text faithfully.</p>
            </div>
            <div type="translation">
                <p>translation(s)</p>
